# ============================================================
# Third-party licensed models — NEVER commit these (see issue #84)
# ============================================================
# The SMPL body model (MPI) and the SMAL/SMALST priors derived from it are
# distributed under research licences that do not permit redistribution. This
# repo is MIT-licensed, so these must be obtained by each user directly from
# the upstream sources. See docs/THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md.
#
# NOTE: these patterns are deliberately specific. Our own parametric models
# (3D_model_prep/SMPL_fit*.pkl, smpl_ATTA.pkl, SMPL_STICK.pkl, SMIL*/SMILy*)
# use the SMPL *file format* and naming prefix but are our own work — they are
# NOT covered here and remain tracked.
smal_model/smpl/
data/priors/walking_toy_symmetric_pose_prior*.pkl
data/priors/zebra_walking_symmetric_pose_prior*.pkl

